{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15104","headline":"校书郎杨凝往年以古镜贶别今追赠以诗 · 李益","name":"校书郎杨凝往年以古镜贶别今追赠以诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明镜出匣时，明如云间月。\n一别青春监，回光照华髪。\n美人昔自爱，鞶带手中结。\n愿以三五期，经天无玷缺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}